OL,3,AWhy are European countries moving their
OL,4,Agold out of North America?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen the central bank of the
OL,7,FNetherlands confirmed this week that it
OL,8,Fhad moved tonnes of the country's gold
OL,9,Fout of North America, it said the
OL,10,Frelocation would make it "better
OL,11,Fprepared for severe crises".
OL,13,FSome 86 tonnes from the combined total
OL,14,Fof about 313 tonnes held in the US and
OL,15,FCanada were relocated to London "in
OL,16,Fview of increasing geopolitical
OL,17,Funrest", it said, so the shiny stuff
OL,18,Fcould be "readily available for use in
OL,19,Fa crisis situation".
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
