OL,3,AWhy are European countries moving their
OL,4,Agold out of North America?
OL,5,
OL,6,FQuestions were bound to follow. Why
OL,7,Fwere the Dutch doing this? Were they
OL,8,Fanticipating some major economic shock
OL,9,Fon the horizon?
OL,11,FIt seems not, but the move was clearly
OL,12,Fin response to the unstable and
OL,13,Funcertain state the world finds itself
OL,14,Fin, with trade and military wars
OL,15,Fprompting countries to take precautions
OL,16,Fand hold their gold closer to home.
